---- ordering  =G=  optional

ordering(t1)..  - done(t1) + done(t2) =G= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
ordering(t2)..  - done(t2) + done(t3) =G= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
ordering(t3)..  - done(t3) + done(t4) =G= 0 ; (LHS = 0)
     
