assignment(t1,disk2)..  inv(t1,disk2,pegA) + inv(t1,disk2,pegB) + inv(t1,disk2,pegC) =E= 1 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 1 ****)
     
assignment(t1,disk3)..  inv(t1,disk3,pegA) + inv(t1,disk3,pegB) + inv(t1,disk3,pegC) =E= 1 ; (LHS = 0, INFES = 1 ****)
     
